Authored research material
---------------------------

The fluid-simulation videos in `src/assets/fluid-simulation/` were produced by
Yunhao Luo during research at Ubisoft La Forge and are shared with Ubisoft's
permission. They contain no internal Ubisoft assets.

The Research page identifies the following first-author publication using
factual bibliographic metadata and an original summary:

    Yunhao Luo, Kaixiang Xie, Sheldon Andrews, and Paul G. Kry. 2021.
    Catching and Throwing Control of a Physically Simulated Hand.
    Motion, Interaction and Games (MIG '21).
    https://doi.org/10.1145/3487983.3488300

The coauthored paper PDF, verbatim abstract, and original publication teaser
are not included. The preview position is occupied by a nonrepresentational
redaction mosaic, and the page links to the DOI and external author project
page for readers who want the publication itself.

